        "sourceText": "# 02｜什么是八字？\n## WHAT IS BAZI?\n\n**状态：** `OPEN`\n\n前一轮已经冻结。\n\n### 客户问题\n> 八字到底在读取什么？\n\n### 主视觉\n`Birth → Four Pillars → Five Elements → Structure → Timing`\n\n---",
