        "sourceText": "# 25｜为什么这样说 + 方法边界\n## EVIDENCE, BOUNDARY & CLOSING\n\n**状态：** `OPEN IN WEB SUMMARY / FULL IN PAID`\n\n这里我建议把原本第 24 Evidence 与第 25 Boundary 合并成一个非常高级的 closing page。\n\n### 客户问题\n> 这些结论来自哪里？哪些地方还不能确定？\n\n### 主视觉\nEvidence Lineage：\n\n```text\nBirth Input\n↓\nBaZi Calculation\n↓\nCanonical Projection\n↓\nAccepted Claims\n↓\nInterpretation\n↓\nCurrent Evidence\n↓\nReport\n```\n\n旁边 4 个状态：\n\n```text\nCALCULATED\nINTERPRETED\nCURRENT EVIDENCE\nOPEN\n```\n\n### 最终固定 Closing\n\n中文：\n\n> 这份八字报告提供的是一种结构与时间视角，而不是对你人生的最终定义。真正有价值的部分，不是把所有结果当成结论，而是知道哪些结构值得观察、哪些解释需要现实验证，以及哪些问题仍然保持开放。\n\n英文：\n\n> This BaZi report offers one structured perspective on pattern and timing rather than a final definition of your life. Its value lies not in treating every result as a conclusion, but in seeing what deserves observation, what requires comparison with Reality, and what should remain open.\n\n---",
