        "sourceText": "# 20｜当前现实比较\n## CURRENT REALITY COMPARISON\n\n`CONDITIONAL + LOCKED`\n\n### 客户问题\n> 我的当前现实是否正在表现出出生基线中的主题？\n\n### 主视觉\n\n```text\nECR BASELINE\n        VS\nCURRENT REALITY\n```\n\n状态沿 shared Current Reality authority：\n\n- Currently Resonant\n- Partially Resonant\n- Currently Not Resonant\n- Open\n\n---",
        "sourcePath": "docs/guided-report-successor-r1/reference-ecr.md",
