        "sourceText": "# 22｜关系、工作与资源\n## RELATIONSHIPS, WORK & RESOURCES\n\n`LOCKED / ADAPTIVE`\n\nECR 不应该为了凑三页硬拆：\n\n- relationship\n- career\n- money\n\n如果当前 Topic authority足够，可以做 3 mini-domain cards：\n\n```text\nRELATIONSHIPS\nWORK\nRESOURCES\n```\n\n如果证据少，保持一页。\n\n---",
        "sourcePath": "docs/guided-report-successor-r1/reference-ecr.md",
