        "sourceText": "# 23｜可观察讯号\n## OBSERVABLE SIGNALS\n\n`LOCKED`\n\n### 客户问题\n> 现实中什么现象值得我特别观察？\n\n最多三条：\n\n```text\nWHEN\nOBSERVE\nCOUNTER-SIGNAL\n```\n\n---",
        "sourcePath": "docs/guided-report-successor-r1/reference-ecr.md",
        "role": "OBSERVABLE_SIGNALS",
        "master": "M08"
